    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sliding window</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Fixed window frequency match</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/find-all-anagrams-in-a-string/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 438</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Find All Anagrams in a String</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every anagram of p has p's length and p's letter counts. Slide a window of length len(p) across s, keep diff = count(p) - count(window) and a counter of letters whose diff is 0, and record each start where all 26 agree. O(n + m) time, O(26) extra space.</p>\n"
